            "review_title": "Review at After 5 Sports Bar",
            "review_text": "Ccb1820\nDa Nang, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nBest Sports Bar in Danang\nJul 2022\nA nice place with great drinks and games. And all games are free to play. You might want to play a game with the owner, he is good at these games. I was there a bit earlier that night and they also helped me to order some food. Very nice and friendly people there. \nBtw, they even got air purifier, never seen it in other bars.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 23, 2022",
